OL,3,GNEWSAPickleball and pensioners help
OL,4,Astudents learn beyond their classroom
OL,5,
OL,6,FPickleball and pensioners are helping
OL,7,FA-Level students learn beyond their
OL,8,Fschool classroom.
OL,10,FAnd the pupils from Breda Academy are
OL,11,Falso helping older people in their
OL,12,Fcommunity feel less lonely.
OL,14,FSome 16, 17 and 18-year olds from the
OL,15,Fschool go to help at the Belvoir estate
OL,16,Fpensioners club every Friday, cooking
OL,17,Flunch and playing games.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
