OL,3,GNEWSAPickleball and pensioners help
OL,4,Astudents learn beyond their classroom
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think it's important as a school to
OL,7,Fget involved in our community, and
OL,8,Fencourage even younger generations to
OL,9,Fget involved in this type of stuff,"
OL,10,Fsaid 18-year-old Anna.
